# /agreement system: SPA shells live at /_shells/agreement and
# /_shells/agreement-signed (renamed to avoid clean-URL strip conflict
# with the redirects below). Worker on agreement.flyiniris.com fetches
# shells from Pages and injects __AGREEMENT_DATA__. These 301s redirect
# couples on legacy flyiniris.com links to the canonical subdomain.
/agreement                 https://agreement.flyiniris.com/agreement              301
/agreement/*               https://agreement.flyiniris.com/agreement/:splat       301
/contract                  https://agreement.flyiniris.com/agreement  301
/contract/*                https://agreement.flyiniris.com/agreement  301
# contract.html deprecated 2026-05-14. The clean-URL /contract rule above does
# not catch the literal .html path once the file is deleted, so this explicit
# rule keeps legacy email links alive. Query string (?token=...) is preserved
# by Cloudflare Pages since the destination has no ? clause.
/contract.html             https://agreement.flyiniris.com/agreement  301
